WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
But I fought too hard before

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,200
These people are hiding in certain places and dare not show their faces

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,800
It's only now that it's slowly moving towards us.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,000
Everything has been arranged, right?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Arranged

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
After coming to us

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Why don't we make arrangements to provide them with food and accommodation?

8
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,080
As long as we are at zero, we will make arrangements and prepare to go to the battlefield.

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,880
But there's something I need to tell you, General.

10
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,720
The weapons we have here are seriously lacking in fake wrinkles.

11
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,640
Especially fake wrinkles

12
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,160
Basically everything was broken before.

13
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,440
There are also weapons

14
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,880
I hit you too hard before

15
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,840
Many of our current weapons have been worn out to the point of being unusable.

16
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,360
Now so many people are here again

17
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,360
We need to allocate new weapons to them

18
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,640
I'm afraid there will really be a fight then

19
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:36,120
I know those weapons are hard to use unless you have them handy.

20
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,840
I will handle this matter

21
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,760
We got some more clothes back

22
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,760
Have you done the statistics here now?

23
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,120
But it hasn’t been posted yet

24
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:47,280
I think what's more important is that we need to be prepared. I know I'll find a way, General Xiao.

25
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,840
Now you have to solve everything

26
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,160
I'm really sorry

27
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,480
These things should have been dealt with by us.

28
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,600
But we really don’t know how to solve it, so it’s okay

29
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,080
You can't solve these things

30
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,400
It's up to me to solve it
